    "content": "Here we launched Atlassian's Bitbucket-Tests (BBTS) New UI in Open Beta.  🚀 \nNow, Stop wasting hours chasing ghost failures from flaky tests that pass on retry.\nBitbucket Standard and Premium now feature native Bitbucket Tests dashboards, giving you deep visibility into test reliability right where your code lives:\n📊 Instant Health Breakdown: Track total, healthy, flaky, and quarantined tests at a glance. 🎯 \"Needs Attention\" Card: Pinpoint the exact tests dragging down your suite. \n🔍 One-Click CI/CD Drill-Downs: Jump straight from a build result to deep execution history using \"View in Tests.\" \n📈 Historical Trends: Spot systemic patterns before they hit production, and fix Flaky tests using our 𝐟𝐢𝐱 𝐟𝐥𝐚𝐤𝐲 𝐚𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐭.\nNo more guessing if a test failure is real noise or a false positive. Just cleaner pipelines and faster deployments.\nHow does your team currently handle flaky tests? Let’s talk in the comments! 👇\nBlog - https://lnkd.in/e72kcYBb\nCommunity post - https://lnkd.in/eHmxN99X",
